        <mxCell id="n" value="The rank is the length of the longest chain of predecessors. An XSLT sorts by it. If two names have different ranks, a chain must connect them; otherwise the ordering is rejected as not a strict weak order. A cycle is rejected too." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
